---
import { ACQUISITION_MAILTO, MAKE_OFFER_MAILTO, SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<!-- Poignant Closer -->
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center py-8 border-y border-white/10">
  <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-white/90">
    When organizations need help securing AI,<br />
    there is one place they'll look first.
  </p>
</div>

<section id="pricing" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs tracking-[1.5px] font-semibold mb-4">PREMIUM ACQUISITION — AVAILABLE NOW</div>
    <h2 id="pricing-heading" class="section-header tracking-[-0.03em]">Own the help they're looking for.</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-white/60">Buy <span class="text-white font-medium">secureaiframeworks.help</span> today for {SITE.priceDisplay} USD, or start with an offer.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="glass rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-14 border border-white/10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-y-8">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-x-2">
          <span class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tighter">{SITE.priceDisplay}</span>
          <span class="text-white/50 text-xl">USD</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-white/60">One-time acquisition • Full ownership &amp; instant transfer</p>

        <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-x-2 text-white/70">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Clean title, ready for transfer</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-x-2 text-white/70">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Escrow.com protected transaction</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-x-2 text-white/70">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Payment plans available on request</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:text-right">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:items-stretch">
          <a href={ACQUISITION_MAILTO}
             data-cta="buy-now-pricing"
             class="inline-flex w-full md:w-auto items-center justify-center px-10 py-4 min-h-[48px] rounded-3xl bg-white font-semibold text-[#0a0a0f] text-lg active:scale-[0.985] transition-all hover:bg-white/90">
            Buy Now — {SITE.priceDisplay}
          </a>
          <a href={MAKE_OFFER_MAILTO()}
             data-cta="make-offer-pricing"
             class="inline-flex w-full md:w-auto items-center justify-center px-10 py-3 min-h-[48px] rounded-3xl border border-white/20 font-medium text-white text-base hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            Make Offer
          </a>
          <a href="#inquire"
             data-cta="contact-agent-pricing"
             class="inline-flex w-full md:w-auto items-center justify-center px-10 py-3 min-h-[48px] rounded-3xl border border-white/10 text-white/70 text-base hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            Contact Agent
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/50 mt-3 md:mt-2">Serious buyers only. Flexible terms available.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs text-white/50 max-w-md mx-auto">
      Owning the ".help" version of a high-value, descriptive phrase in a critical category creates powerful long-term brand equity and trust positioning.
    </p>
    <nav class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs text-white/40" aria-label="Related sections">
      <a href="#why" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">Why this domain</a>
      <a href="#uses" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">Ideal use cases</a>
      <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">Transfer FAQ</a>
      <a href="#inquire" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">Inquire</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>
